          "title": "Substitute",
          "body": "Substitute:\n\n\\[\nx^2+(x+2)^2+(x+2)=3\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx^2+x^2+4x+4+x+2=3\n\\]\n\n\\[\n2x^2+5x+3=0\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(2x+3)(x+1)=0\n\\]"
        },
